# Juvaana Analytics

Juvaana Analytics is a Python library for interactive Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), visualization, and HTML reporting.

## Features
- Interactive graphs (scatter, line, bar, histogram, box plots)
- Correlation analysis
- Automated dataset profiling
- HTML report generation
- Extensible analytics engine

## Installation

```bash
pip install juvaana-analytics
